age. The arrangement visually demonstrates a simple tree structure with a s=
ingle root node ('red') and three leaf nodes ('bed,' 'rad,' and 'rod')." lo=
ading=3D"lazy" width=3D"204" height=3D"93" decoding=3D"async" data-nimg=3D"=
