/coding-patterns/graphs/shortest-transformation-sequence/image-13-06-2-CEF3=
HC4I.svg?dpl=3Ddpl_CEjisbLnWxFQGUTRjiHGoKY1oV5c"></div></figure>
<p>Similarly, we can make a direct connection between each word and its one=
-letter-off neighbors:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
img alt=3D"Image represents a directed acyclic graph (DAG) where nodes repr=
esent words and edges represent relationships between them.  The topmost no=
de is labeled 'red,' connected to three nodes below: 'bed,' 'rad,' and 'rod=
